1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,755
142 applications.

2
00:00:01,785 --> 00:00:02,920
Zero replies.

3
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,572
The reports I used to build?

4
00:00:04,602 --> 00:00:06,188
They build themselves now.

5
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,537
So I ran a text
check on my résumé.

6
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:10,506
The extracted text was noise.

7
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,726
Fine. I know how
to fix bad data.

8
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:15,947
One column. Real text.

9
00:00:15,977 --> 00:00:17,432
Now it reads in order.

10
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,091
Then roles that fit.

11
00:00:20,121 --> 00:00:22,749
Fewer applications,
each one sent by me.

12
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,202
No one can promise what
every screening system does.

13
00:00:26,232 --> 00:00:27,220
But I can check.

14
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,770
AI changed the market.

15
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,493
It didn't change what I'm worth.

